/* 8.5 ATR 雙向和諧 — Language 檔(路徑 B);語意同 tshiatun/examples/8_5_atr.qy */

Feature atrsrc(+atrsrc)

Symbol p
Symbol a
Symbol i [+atrsrc]

Class vowel {a, i}

Melody atr {+ATR} anchor mora

global trait Phonology:
    phon:
        insert +ATR floating near mora / [+atrsrc] _
        dock atr&floating strategy nearest
        spread +ATR bidirectional within stem on-conflict stop
